<title>USA: CBOE membership sells for record $635,000.</title>
<headline>CBOE membership sells for record $635,000.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Chicago Board Options Exchange said Monday an exchange membership sold for a record price for the second time this month.</p>
<p>The membership sold for $635,000, up from the previous record of $630,000 set March 10.</p>
<p>After Monday's sale, memberships were offered at $695,000.</p>
<p>((--Derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
